Thank you, Olivier.  We had also found this, and changed it for the next 
release.  But I neglected to post to the list that users could change it 
in their own version in the meanwhile, so thanks for pointing it out.  
The simplest way to do it is to replace:

nw[,] <- 0

with

nw <- delete.edges(nw,1:length(nw$mel))

Cheers,
Steve


